    ],
    "text": "I, Hanif Yusoof, the Governor of the Western Province, according to the powers vested upon me under the Section 02(2) of the Co-operative Societies Statute of Western Provincial Council No. 03 of 1998: that shall be read with the Act, 154(c) of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, hereby notify that powers speci\ufb01 ed under the Column III of its schedule will be delegated to the post holder mentioned in Column II, corresponding to the name of Column I in the following schedule, that is appointed to assist the Commissioner of Co-operative Development of Western Province and the Registrar of Co-operative Societies of the Western Province with e\ufb00 ect from 01.08.2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
